      "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef main():\n    X = np.load('vectors.npy', mmap_mode='r')  # (8000, 1024) float32\n    n = X.shape[0]\n\n    # Convert once to float64 for accurate distance computation\n    Xf = np.asarray(X, dtype=np.float64)\n\n    # Precompute squared norms\n    norms = np.einsum('ij,ij->i', Xf, Xf)\n\n    total = np.float64(0.0)\n    block_size = 500\n\n    for start in range(0, n, block_size):\n        end = min(start + block_size, n)\n        block = Xf[start:end]                     # (b, 1024)\n        dot = block @ Xf.T                         # (b, n) float64, BLAS dgemm\n        dist_sq = norms[start:end, None] + norms[None, :] - 2.0 * dot\n        np.maximum(dist_sq, 0.0, out=dist_sq)      # guard against tiny negatives\n        dist = np.sqrt(dist_sq, out=dist_sq)\n        total += dist.sum(dtype=np.float64)\n\n    # Print with full precision decimal representation\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total:.10f}\")\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
